# A triple click selects the whole line at the pointer: every row of a
# line that wrapped, and its copy ends with one line end; a line of one
# row; and an empty line, which copies its line end alone.
# spec: ADR-1003, the selection; INTERFACE-vtium.md, The selection and copy
# covers: clipboard.selection
size 6 4
send "first line\r\nsecond"
select line at 2,1
copy
select line at 0,0
copy
select line at 3,2
copy
select line at 0,3
copy
dump frame
